    "My interest in fasteners and hooks seems to have been treated as interest in workshop supplies generally.",
    "Items seem to be connected by broad repair uses even when their actual purposes and dimensions differ from what I recently chose."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My two recent magnetic hook purchases make compatible hanging attachments more relevant to me than unrelated repair supplies.",
    "Fastener dimensions and intended use matter: a large washer or furniture insert is not interchangeable with the small hardware I recently bought.",
    "I rarely interact unless something serves a recognizable current purpose; possible usefulness someday is not enough."
  ],
